# #5837: the WAL shard's eviction of L's foreign-high entry folds only the activations'
# tokens into the eviction floor, dropping the empty token's forward high.
MODULE: ForwardHonestEvictionDropsForwardHigh
TARGET: ForwardHonest
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: evicting L's foreign-high entry folds its activations' highs into the eviction floor but drops its forwards'
PERTURBS: Evict
BOUNDS: WithFreeAdvance = TRUE, WithFwdExclusion = TRUE, WithDuplicate = FALSE, WithRestart = TRUE, MaxWindows = 0, WithMixedVersion = FALSE

--- FIND
    /\ evFloor' = Max({evFloor} \cup {o \in Offs : o >= TrackStart /\ author[o] \in Acts \cup {OrphanFwd, FwdD}})
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the forwards' high is not folded.
    /\ evFloor' = Max({evFloor} \cup {o \in Offs : o >= TrackStart /\ author[o] \in Acts})
--- END
